+        # but the packet still cannot satisfy the downstream official-source,
+        # independent-family, candidate, or budget gates.  Mark this exact
+        # turn so the terminal contract rejects the receipt before it can seal
+        # and the conversation loop can stop after one deterministic failure.
+        # Never spend synthesis retries on a packet already known to be
