+        review_two: (
+            "Vendor B cleaned ordinary debris well on both carpet and hard flooring. "
+            "Vendor B has a larger bin but weighs more than Vendor A. "
+            "The comparison found Vendor B left some embedded pet fur in a thick rug. "
+            "Vendor B ran longer in its low-power battery mode. "
+            "The reviewer listed Vendor B as the lower-priced alternative."
+        ),
+    }
+    return (official, review_one, review_two), source_texts
