+            f"The {subject} documentation explains how cancellation is delivered at an await point.",
+            f"Applications using {subject} should preserve cleanup with a finally block.",
+            f"Structured concurrency connects {subject} behavior to sibling task completion.",
+            f"Timeout handling converts {subject} cancellation into a bounded control-flow outcome.",
+            f"Operational code should test {subject} cleanup paths under cancellation pressure.",
+            f"The documented {subject} behavior has limitations when code suppresses cancellation.",
+            (
+                f"The {subject} reference covers CancelledError, uncancel, TaskGroup, "
+                "task group, structured concurrency, timeout, and reschedule behavior."
+            ),
+        ]
